    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reinstate free bus passes for all over 60s in England",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Reinstate free bus travel for over 60s in England. We believe it is unfair that free bus travel is allowed for over 60s in Wales, Scotland and Northern Ireland yet in England the privilege is aligned to state pension age. This concession should be consistent throughout the UK.",
